    finding:       "watchdog S5 enforcement: A0 TPR=0.93, A0.1 TPR=0.87, FPR=0.05",
    latency_p95:   "0.682ms — well within 250ms reflex tick",
    relevance:     "confirms A0/A0.1 dims[53/54] enforcement is orthogonal to PSI angustia;
                    PSI triggers on stasis_cos (structural stress), NOT on ethics violations.
                    Ethics wire routes through dims[53/54] BEFORE SplitOperator, independently.",
