                    Graduated-autonomy gate: τ_tac ≥ 0.90, N ≥ 50, 0 breaches.",
    authority_doc: "docs/spec/strategic_tactical_authority.vsm (R10.1, 2026-06-21)",
  }
  key_finding: "viable_full=false may be structurally unreachable under normal operation.
                The system self-regulates before reaching non-viability.
                θ_PSI is therefore a PRECAUTIONARY threshold, not a failure threshold."
